// A whole program in one module: the smallest root a build can be
// pointed at, which is what this test is measuring the ENTRY PROBE
// against. It imports nothing, so the walk queues exactly one unit and
// the code that comes back is about finding the file and nothing else.
//
// A program of MORE than one module is `build_puts_every_module_in_one
// _tree` beside this, and it is a different question.

Answer* = {
    n*: i32,
}

answer* = () i32 { 42 }
